=== SPEC VERIFICATION ===

The spec for Target 5 (Client Options) says:
  'WithStreamMiddlewareBuilder(mwb cep.StreamMiddlewareBuilder) StreamOption'

This means the functions should use cep package types, not streamx types!

Checking if cep package has the required types:
// StreamMiddleware is a chainable wrapper around a StreamEndpoint.
type StreamMiddleware func(StreamEndpoint) StreamEndpoint
// StreamRecvMiddleware is a chainable wrapper around a StreamRecvEndpoint.
type StreamRecvMiddleware func(StreamRecvEndpoint) StreamRecvEndpoint
// StreamSendMiddleware is a chainable wrapper around a StreamSendEndpoint.
type StreamSendMiddleware func(StreamSendEndpoint) StreamSendEndpoint
// StreamMiddlewareBuilder builds a stream middleware with information from a context.
type StreamMiddlewareBuilder func(ctx context.Context) StreamMiddleware
// StreamRecvMiddlewareBuilder builds a stream recv middleware with information from a context.
type StreamRecvMiddlewareBuilder func(ctx context.Context) StreamRecvMiddleware
